{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39748","headline":"奉和翁文尧十九员外中谢日蒙恩赐金紫之什 · 黄滔","name":"奉和翁文尧十九员外中谢日蒙恩赐金紫之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"面蒙君赐自龙墀，谁是还乡一袭衣。\n三品易悬鳞鬣赫，八丝展起彩章飞。\n敻爲胜事垂千古，题作新诗啓七微。\n严助买臣精魄在，定应羞着昔年归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39748.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39748","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}